title: "AI shopping-answer sources for hand massager questions (ChatGPT and Perplexity, Oct 2026)"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Erin
    given-names: Muhammed Veysel
    affiliation: Wearmelly
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-19
license: CC-BY-4.0
url: "https://wearmelly.com"
abstract: "Which web sources two AI assistants (ChatGPT and Perplexity) cited or inspected when answering 39 shopping questions about hand massagers, recorded over 137 runs on 2026-10-16 and 2026-10-19: 2900 source rows (472 cited, 2428 inspected) across 456 domains, plus 296 search sub-queries the assistants issued. Descriptive counts only: AI answers vary run to run. The answers themselves are not included. This dataset makes no medical claims. Compiled by Wearmelly (wearmelly.com), which sells Melly, a heated hand massager not included in this dataset."
keywords:
  - AI search
  - ChatGPT
  - Perplexity
  - cited sources
  - shopping questions
  - hand massager
  - generative engine optimization
  - open data
